  "reviewed_runtime_boundaries": [
    "World 6 difficulties use direct public level 55, 72, 81 and 90 values; no interpolation is used.",
    "Omen of Everlasting Freeze creates two owner-scaled, targetable Ice Edges; phase two also creates Bronya (Complete).",
    "Hoarfrost and Doomsday Ice Cascade apply a resistible one-turn Freeze that blocks the normal action and deals 112.5% applier ATK delayed Ice damage.",
    "Intensifying Cold follows Freeze application and removal, adding 10% ordinary damage per currently Frozen opponent to Cocolia and her surviving summons.",
    "Reverberating Ice requires a Frozen primary target, removes its Freeze, hits adjacent units, and repeats the primary strike when an adjacent unit is Frozen.",
    "Wrath of Winterland Saints applies a one-turn 30% damage boost and its AI state always transitions to Punishment of Endless Winter.",
    "The phase-three graph begins with Doomsday Ice Cascade, which damages all opponents and selects one non-Frozen target for Freeze.",
    "The three phase graphs, summons, delayed control, conditional repeat, timeline manipulation and damage modifiers use shared Rule IR without a native handler."
  ]
